  "releaseNotes": "Rich Authorization Requests (RFC 9396), Token Exchange (RFC 8693), DPoP sender-constrained tokens (RFC 9449), certificate-bound access token verification (RFC 8705), JARM signed authorization responses, JWT-secured token introspection (RFC 9701), JWE-encrypted request objects (RFC 9101), signed authorization server metadata (RFC 8414), and secure-by-default hardening (Implicit Flow opt-in, Initial Access Token for client registration). Full details: https://github.com/Abblix/Oidc.Server/releases/tag/v2.3",
